<guid>https://picnob.com/post/6754683134694937291128</guid>
<description>
<![CDATA[
I wanted to give you an update on my record . When I made , it i believed this was my last record so I made the record I always wanted to make . I was in the hospital mostly but when I wasn’t all I did was write &amp; record it .I want to tour more than anything. &amp; I want to sing . That’s what keeps my soul &amp; body happy .This album has so many incredible people who helped me , who gave me their best , were patient with the trauma . @butchwalker , @michaelstipe , Will Sargent , @xmadmx , Billie Joe Armstrong , Eg White , @moodyslowchords , @suzyshinn , @jdloveless &amp; more .I’m not going to tell people red is blue anymore .Thank you for giving me the grace I need to prepare how to enter the world again .Courtney ️<p><img src="https://prank-arum.github.io/Feeds/Instagram/courtneylove/6754683134694937291128.jpg"><p><a href="https://picnob.com/post/6754683134694937291128">Original post on Picnob</a>]]>
</description>
